      "GRETCHEN: You’ re peddling a Wolfson knock-off and lecturing me on playing it safe?\nRHODORA: Your website doesn’t give a sense of scale or texture but seeing your work for the first time today at the new artists fair I had that oh-my…",
      "COCO/INTO PHONE: Haze Gallery please hold ... Haze Gallery Please hold ... Haze Gallery please hold--\nRHODORA/OVERHEARD ON PHONE: You’re sure it’s the same Dease?",
      "RHODORA/OVER PHONE: Send them over and wash your hands of it. And double your bill.\nCOCO/INTO PHONE: Haze Gallery, can I help you?",
      "GRETCHEN: I want them exhibited ASAP. Main hall, new wing, event marketing.\nMUSEUM CURATING WOMAN: You know we have a process Gretchen.\nGRETCHEN: I had a glorious concept to support my former employer and supposedly premier contemporary art museum in Los Angeles with the first showing …",
      "RHODORA: Don’t try to tart this up or I’1l bar the rights for all Dease images and repros. Wouldn’t be much of a book then would it?\nRHODORA: Your girl’s got the hots for artists.\nJOSEPHINA: Jesus did you take Viagra or something?"
    ]
